# Build context for the standalone vue-front images (Dockerfile / Dockerfile.dev).
# Keep host artifacts out so `COPY . .` does not overwrite the container's own
# `npm ci` output with host node_modules / stale dist (which breaks
# cross-platform builds, e.g. Windows/macOS host -> Linux container).
# `.env` is intentionally NOT ignored: Dockerfile.dev needs DEV_PROXY_TARGET at
# runtime, and that value is non-VITE so it is never baked into the client bundle.
node_modules
dist
.vite
npm-debug.log*
.env.local
.env.*.local
